  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/137/8a74f5515096596bed87422caacd89a3..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/137/c53f6fd51d6ec34c17ce35dd00dadb62..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">あむしの新人服を見納めできた</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんか、6階で、、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">私もね、シフトミスって木曜日を見納めにしちゃったから</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">他店舗見納めだったんだ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">そこまで同じとか</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">面白いんだな。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おめでとうあむし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">朝起きて、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">あむちゃんに逢いに行くかー</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">となり、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">よたよたといきました</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">日奈森あむみたいなふくで🎀&gt; . &lt;🎀</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">あむちゃんは6階でもいっぱい動いてて偉かった♪</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">マブです。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/137/187479aab9cc64e17d86d0f1e78608be..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">6階のまかすいチャレンジ成功。</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"